      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-need",
      "description": "Line-shape status: need (rubric dashed), ok (solid), warn (computed shortfall), off (excluded).",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip ds-need\">정할 것 14건</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-ok\">조건 모두 지킴</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-warn\">기준에 모자란 교육 5개</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-off\">제외</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 8px;font:700 12.5px/1.5 'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.ds-need{border:1.5px dashed #c8102e;color:#c8102e;background:#fff}.ds-ok{border:1.5px solid #1f6b3f;color:#1f6b3f;background:#fff}.ds-warn{border:1.5px solid #1a1d1a;color:#1a1d1a;background:#e6e8e2}.ds-off{border:1.5px solid #9aa39b;color:#5b6b60;text-decoration:line-through}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rail Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "rail-nav-item",
      "description": "Green rail with numbered tools and tool-color tabs.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-rail\"><a href=\"#\">도구 고르기</a><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"ds-n\">01</span><span class=\"ds-tab\" style=\"background:#6d3fc0\"></span>학사일정</a><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-n\">02</span><span class=\"ds-tab\" style=\"background:#2563c9\"></span>시수계산</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;background:#1f4d3a;padding:18px;width:232px;font:14px/1.5 'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,sans-serif}.ds-rail a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;color:#eef4ef;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-rail a:hover{background:#163a2b}.ds-rail a[aria-current=page]{background:#fafaf7;color:#1a1d1a;font-weight:700}.ds-rail a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2563c9;outline-offset:2px}.ds-n{width:18px;font-size:12px;color:#b3cbbc;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}a[aria-current=page] .ds-n{color:#5b6b60}.ds-tab{width:8px;height:20px;border-radius:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Timetable Column",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "tool-band",
      "description": "Ink-gap grid cell with a tool-color header band.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tt\"><section class=\"ds-col\"><div class=\"ds-hd\" style=\"background:#2563c9\">02 시수계산<span>9개 반</span></div><div class=\"ds-cell\"><h2>시수계산</h2><p>휴일·고사·행사로 빠지는 수업을 반별로 세요.</p></div></section><section class=\"ds-col\"><div class=\"ds-hd\" style=\"background:#f2a900;color:#1a1d1a\">04 반배정<span>120명</span></div><div class=\"ds-cell\"><h2>반배정</h2><p>조건을 지키며 반을 나눠요.</p></div></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2px;border:2px solid #1a1d1a;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#1a1d1a;font-family:'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,sans-serif}.ds-col{background:#fff}.ds-hd{padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;color:#fff;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:2px solid #1a1d1a}.ds-hd span{font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-cell{padding:20px 18px 18px}.ds-cell h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-cell p{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3f4a42}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Period Bar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "period-bar-cell-large",
      "description": "Signature 7-cell period bar, filled with the owning tool color.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pbar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"1-3, 5-6교시\" style=\"--c:#2563c9\"><i class=\"on\">1</i><i class=\"on\">2</i><i class=\"on\">3</i><i>4</i><i class=\"on\">5</i><i class=\"on\">6</i><i>7</i></span>",
      "css": ".ds-pbar{display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:2px;width:240px}.ds-pbar i{height:22px;border-radius:2px;background:#e8eae3;font:normal 700 12px/22px 'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,sans-serif;text-align:center;color:#4f5a52;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-pbar i.on{background:var(--c,#1a1d1a);color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "button",
      "description": "Ink-outlined segments with rubric-dashed decision counts.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\">1학기 <span class=\"ds-count\">6</span></button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">2학기 <span class=\"ds-count\">8</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{display:inline-flex;border:1.5px solid #1a1d1a;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}.ds-seg button{border:0;border-right:1.5px solid #1a1d1a;background:none;padding:6px 14px;font:600 13.5px/1.5 'Pretendard Variable',Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#1a1d1a;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}.ds-seg button:last-child{border-right:0}.ds-seg button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#1a1d1a;color:#fff}.ds-seg button:not([aria-pressed=true]):hover{background:#f2f4ee}.ds-seg button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2563c9;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-count{min-width:20px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;text-align:center;background:#fff;color:#c8102e;border:1.5px dashed #c8102e;font-weight:800}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "교실 시간표판 (The Classroom Timetable Board)",
    "overview": "The app is a felt-green bulletin rail holding a white board, and everything on the board is read the way a teacher reads a timetable: day columns, period cells, ink-ruled grids. Schedules, hours and class lists sit in cells separated by 2px ink rules; each of the four tools owns one subject-paper color that appears only on its header band and in its data. Density is Operate-mode: 13-14px body, tabular numerals, tables and calendars that fill the board, no decoration between the user and the data.\n\nState is carried by line shape before color: a solid line means confirmed, a dashed rubric line means a person must decide, a strike line means excluded. Computed shortfalls get their own tool-neutral mark (grey wash, ink text, ink underline) so the rubric red never means two things. The board is flat; depth comes from the green rail framing a pale board and from ink borders, not from shadows. The rejected default is the grey SaaS sidebar over a card grid.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Green rail (232px) framing a pale board with a 10px corner; board content on white paper cells.",
      "Grids drawn as 2px gaps over an ink background inside a 2px ink border.",
      "Four tool colors used only for header bands, period-bar fills and tool data highlights.",
      "One rubric red, dashed, reserved for human decisions, unresolved notations and rule violations.",
      "The 7-cell period bar is the shared signature across every tool.",
      "Pretendard throughout, tabular numerals wherever numbers align."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Rubric Rule",
